1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:06,560
Every morning, my mother's old
coffee cup tells us a quiet story.

2
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:15,920
She grew up in Yeki, in Sheka Zone, where
life was hard and chances were few.

3
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:19,943
Despite the hardship
around her, she grew into

4
00:00:19,943 --> 00:00:23,350
a hardworking, caring and
determined woman.

5
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:28,465
When she took on raising
her children, hardship

6
00:00:28,465 --> 00:00:32,710
tested her strength,
patience and resolve.

7
00:00:33,410 --> 00:00:39,680
She gave up her time, her comfort
and many of her own dreams,

8
00:00:41,410 --> 00:00:45,380
so that we could have the
chances she never had.

9
00:00:49,410 --> 00:00:53,764
Her love was not only
spoken; it showed in

10
00:00:53,764 --> 00:00:59,040
countless acts of care,
endurance and sacrifice.

11
00:00:59,740 --> 00:01:04,838
Today we know: a mother's
love is measured not only by

12
00:01:04,838 --> 00:01:10,330
what she says, but by what
she gives, endures and does.

13
00:01:11,030 --> 00:01:15,967
Time passes, but her values
and her sacrifice remain

14
00:01:15,967 --> 00:01:21,110
our family's identity, for
the generations to come.
